<title>Haiti's gang war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/haiti/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-haiti-2026-10-11T12:24:57.470Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 11 Oct 2026 12:24:57 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Violent clashes continue between the Viv Ansanm gangs and Haitian security forces, now reinforced by a Kenya‑led multinational mission, in Port‑Au‑Prince, Kenscoff and Gros‑Morne, while the police high command meets departmental directors. A new gang suppression force has been launched, and the Dominican army has supplied large ammunition stocks to the 400 Mawozo gang, increasing gang firepower. Taiwan has offered security‑experience sharing with Haiti, and a U.S. missionary was arrested on child‑sex‑abuse allegations. The Haitian electoral council dropped a rule barring candidates sanctioned by foreign countries. The UCDP recorded 193 battle‑related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifkFVX3lxTE1PSDNZYklwbFlURFR4ZWw5TXBzM2kxUUV5SEZfZHFESFdkUVU2Q2tKUHZJSzBNeFNGZmlfTUQtb0pzaFJZNllRRjNMajF1RkJBdkNkcGF4aHVabFF4TzNteUhEQWVsazkxMnhJeFdSZVZfekluWW8xZjJSX2VYQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Trinidad Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiZkFVX3lxTFBPWHNPRTVPcHhmS05CQjU5SmQ5eHRCbjMyT1JCM1FscEc4TllBTW05YTllM1MtaXNtNUdnVW5MUWpEV19VWjgwT19aOXhicS1haWhjc3JPdVYyMVd1LURmbU9wbGFzZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Morning&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxPZzZmZnVXUzRPTzVIMUxKTEhIdkVxQUQ5Rk5tc19HdjAyTDdQb2FDODhlcG1pVEVYbDVuME54T3ctSUVPSXc3Q09EWVoxb3ZubV9Ualg2aHM0QVpMOHhVbkpoZVNYbi11c0REYTVubmpnd2pRc09zTlljeW1jQms3b2lVbFZMUFE2OVBDYU02N0RVd0x4LVE?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Haitian Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinAFBVV95cUxNckxIYk5udXQ2c1M0R2FNM2ltUjBjYmRNRW4yMERObkp2Qy15OEwtYUNGVDJOeWUzaUlwWk1WX2hocXNkSFpjR2xSeS02Z3Q2MWdNbU1sRGdCazd2N1hJOUE0V3pMUjFDQmQtUTF3Q2lRbjNaeDlKMzUtTVdXdWwyTk52aWs3U1hzT1M3S1hmOTZkQ2phMndm